<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Delhi To Sawai Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the best packer and mover from Delhi to Sawai Madhopur ensure my goods are protected during the 850 km highway transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our team applies a 7‑layer protective packaging system that starts with high‑density bubble cushioning and multi‑ply corrugated sheets, followed by foam edge protectors, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates for fragile items. Each layer is designed to absorb shocks, resist moisture, and secure loads, while our GPS‑tracked containers provide real‑time monitoring throughout the Delhi‑to‑Sawai journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a smooth intercity move from Delhi to Sawai Madhopur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, the original GSTIN certificate of the mover, an e‑Way bill generated for the cargo, and a signed packing list. Our IBA‑approved movers also prepare a transit declaration and insurance paperwork, ensuring compliance with both central and state regulations for hassle‑free clearance at every checkpost.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while it travels from Delhi to Sawai Madhopur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All our specialized container trucks are equipped with satellite‑based GPS units that feed live location data to our customer portal. You can view real‑time progress, estimated arrival times, and receive instant alerts for any unexpected delays, giving you full visibility over the entire Delhi‑to‑Sawai route.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for Delhi‑to‑Sawai moving calculated and what factors influence the final price?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost matrix considers four primary factors: the type and size of the container truck (18ft, 22ft, or 32ft MX), total distance (≈850 km), volume and weight of goods, and the level of protective packaging and insurance selected. Additional services such as disassembly, reassembly, or expedited delivery are quoted separately, ensuring transparent pricing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the cargo insured during the transit from Delhi to Sawai Madhopur, and what does the insurance cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment is covered by 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. The policy protects against loss, theft, accidental damage, and natural hazards throughout the journey. In case of any claim, our dedicated support team assists with documentation and swift settlement, giving you peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers the best packer and mover from Delhi to Sawai Madhopur compared to other providers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 15‑year legacy, ISO 9001:2015 certification, IBA approval, and a 4.9/5 Google rating set us apart. We operate a fleet of 120+ owned trucks, use a proprietary 7‑layer packaging system, and provide live GPS tracking and full insurance coverage, ensuring reliability, safety, and transparency for every Delhi‑to‑Sawai relocation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special considerations for moving two‑wheelers or cars on the Delhi‑to‑Sawai route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. We use enclosed multi‑car trailers with hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings to secure two‑wheelers and cars. Each vehicle is inspected, documented, and insured separately, and our drivers follow a dedicated loading protocol to prevent any movement or damage during the 850 km transit.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
